WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:08.404
Your child reads the eight words. Mark each word said all at once, with no sounding out loud.

3
00:00:08.854 --> 00:00:13.619
Then the two sentences. Mark a sentence if no word in it was sounded out loud.

4
00:00:14.069 --> 00:00:16.777
Do not help on this page, and do not use a timer.

5
00:00:17.227 --> 00:00:18.603
Then add the two numbers.

6
00:00:19.053 --> 00:00:20.928
Eight or more, go on to day six.

7
00:00:21.378 --> 00:00:27.033
Fewer than eight, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

8
00:00:27.483 --> 00:00:32.724
Then play the game on the next page. Your child picks one box from each of the three groups.

9
00:00:33.174 --> 00:00:38.936
Together, the three boxes make one silly sentence. For example: A big dog hid on the bed.

10
00:00:39.386 --> 00:00:44.289
Your child colors a star for each sentence. Six stars, and the game is done.
